1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 21]</font>

15
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

16
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

17
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:33,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why hasn't the Prince returned yet?</font>

18
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He went to have a drink with Mr. Jiang.</font>

19
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

20
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Divine Dust</font>

21
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not normally sold on the market.</font>

22
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For today's Moon Banquet,</font>

23
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the host brought it out
to honor the guests.</font>

24
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want,</font>

25
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can assist you in savoring it.</font>

26
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think I can't afford this?</font>

27
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You earlier made this banquet</font>

28
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sound absolutely spectacular.</font>

29
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is the promised treasure?</font>

30
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

31
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did not come here for nothing.</font>

32
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, please be patient.</font>

33
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine things</font>

34
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">require a little more waiting.</font>

35
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for what?</font>

36
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you.</font>

37
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My time is precious.</font>

38
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't bring out
the treasure soon,</font>

39
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm leaving right now.</font>

40
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes.</font>

41
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much longer must we wait?</font>

42
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why hasn't the treasure appeared yet?</font>

43
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When will you bring out the treasure?</font>

44
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, please be patient.</font>

45
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The banquet will begin shortly.</font>

46
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Shadow Master is here.</font>

47
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Thunderbolt Bomb.</font>

48
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If any of you</font>

49
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have served in the military,</font>

50
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you may have heard of this device.</font>

51
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It may look unassuming,</font>

52
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but in truth,</font>

53
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">its destructive power is astonishing.</font>

54
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inside this sphere is a mixture</font>

55
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of saltpeter, sulfur, and iron filings.</font>

56
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once this fuse</font>

57
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is lit,</font>

58
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it will detonate in an instant.</font>

59
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just one of these</font>

60
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is enough to level an entire house.</font>

61
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

62
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's called the Thunderbolt Bomb.</font>

63
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The late emperor decreed</font>

64
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this weapon was too lethal</font>

65
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and ordered its formula destroyed
long ago.</font>

66
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He forbade anyone from making it.</font>

67
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

68
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can there be so many here?</font>

69
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed. How did so many appear?</font>

70
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's merely an inanimate object.</font>

71
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Its effectiveness depends</font>

72
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">entirely on the user,</font>

73
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the timing,</font>

74
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the method of use.</font>

75
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone here</font>

76
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a friend of Nightfall Haven.</font>

77
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As a gesture of our sincerity,</font>

78
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we've brought this peerless treasure</font>

79
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to share with all of you.</font>

80
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though I am the Shadow Master here,</font>

81
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not</font>

82
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the true master of this place.</font>

83
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What allows this haven to transcend</font>

84
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the mundane world</font>

85
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the radiance</font>

86
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of the moon above.</font>

87
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could she be...</font>

88
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle?</font>

89
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, don't mention her name.</font>

90
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is she doing here?</font>

91
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Nightfall Haven's sincerity.</font>

92
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We also hope you</font>

93
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will show yourselves in return</font>

94
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and remove your masks.</font>

95
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let us meet with open hearts.</font>

96
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We came here merely for leisure.</font>

97
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do your ambitions</font>

98
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have to do with us?</font>

99
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed. None of our business.</font>

100
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shadow Master,</font>

101
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please let us leave.</font>

102
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, let us go.</font>

103
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Let us leave.
- Let us go.</font>

104
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you have attended the banquet,</font>

105
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must remove</font>

106
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these masks.</font>

107
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

108
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since no one wishes to show their face,</font>

109
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will step forward first</font>

110
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and greet you all.</font>

111
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bunch of cowards.</font>

112
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What use is bowing your heads?</font>

113
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not here to negotiate with you.</font>

114
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have only two choices.</font>

115
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Either submit to me,</font>

116
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or die.</font>

117
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To join hands with me</font>

118
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and forge a new dynasty,</font>

119
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should consider it an honor.</font>

120
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Without my protection,</font>

121
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what standing</font>

122
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would you have in Beiyuan?</font>

123
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai!</font>

124
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards! Protect the Princess!</font>

125
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Protect the Princess!</font>

126
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Move!
- Go!</font>

127
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

128
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">until the killer is caught,</font>

129
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should stay out of sight.</font>

130
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one leaves this island.</font>

131
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, all my careful planning</font>

132
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for this long-laid scheme</font>

133
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be utterly ruined.</font>

134
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest assured, Your Highness.</font>

135
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

136
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems Prince Duan has made his move.</font>

137
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill everyone on the island.</font>

138
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move out!</font>

139
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes!</font>

140
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Board the ship!</font>

141
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

142
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

143
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so late.</font>

144
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:07,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What brings you here?</font>

145
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Earlier today,</font>

146
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you drank with the Prince.</font>

147
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then he vanished into thin air.</font>

148
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you do to him?</font>

149
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't do anything.</font>

150
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just ran into each other</font>

151
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and had a few drinks</font>

152
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to pass the time.</font>

153
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd believe that about anyone else.</font>

154
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you two drinking together?</font>

155
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's definitely going on.</font>

156
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

157
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swear to you:</font>

158
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really not lying.</font>

159
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't tell him anything.</font>

160
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

161
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me ask you one thing.</font>

162
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does your discussion</font>

163
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">concern me?</font>

164
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You promised him,</font>

165
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and bound by your word,</font>

166
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't tell me what was said.</font>

167
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am I right?</font>

168
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is</font>

169
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince's fault.</font>

170
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I apologize to you on his behalf.</font>

171
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever he does,</font>

172
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he shouldn't have dragged you into this.</font>

173
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao is truly despicable.</font>

174
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

175
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's utterly despicable.</font>

176
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But at least he still has a heart.</font>

177
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He treats you quite well.</font>

178
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, you don't have to tell me.</font>

179
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The only one who can give him orders now</font>

180
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is none other than His Majesty.</font>

181
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He came to you</font>

182
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because he thought he'd die there.</font>

183
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why he entrusted me to you.</font>

184
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

185
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But not entirely.</font>

186
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't stand it anymore.</font>

187
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been killing me.</font>

188
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A real man</font>

189
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">knows what to do</font>

190
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and what not to do.</font>

191
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keeping it from you weighed on me.</font>

192
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt uneasy and ashamed.</font>

193
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I ever face you again?</font>

194
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

195
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do you mean by that?</font>

196
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao told me everything.</font>

197
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are Qin Wei, the second daughter</font>

198
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Governor Qin.</font>

199
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He traded his life for this.</font>

200
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said if something happened to him,</font>

201
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should give it to you.</font>

202
00:09:57,720 --> 00:10:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pardon for Qin Minzhi
and his family's treason]</font>

203
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

204
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Long time no see.</font>

205
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could the Shadow Master be you?</font>

206
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your family</font>

207
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the reason I'm suffering today.</font>

208
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai.</font>

209
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good job.</font>

210
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

211
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you were...</font>

212
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was merely a double
raised by the Princess.</font>

213
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her death means nothing.</font>

214
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To kill a mere double,</font>

215
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you threw away your life.</font>

216
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a pity.</font>

217
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your foresight is truly profound.</font>

218
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I admit defeat.</font>

219
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I sensed tonight would not be peaceful.</font>

220
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you turned out</font>

221
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be a surprise.</font>

222
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You hold a lofty position.</font>

223
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd never risk coming alone.</font>

224
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This island is already under my control.</font>

225
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me who your accomplice is.</font>

226
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I can grant you a swift death.</font>

227
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you so certain</font>

228
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I did not come alone?</font>

229
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you did not cherish your life,</font>

230
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could you have endured
with this frail body?</font>

231
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If my life</font>

232
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can buy peace for Beiyuan,</font>

233
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would that not be a worthy trade?</font>

234
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enemy attack!</font>

235
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An enemy attack outside!</font>

236
00:12:33,800 --> 00:12:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Knock him out.</font>

237
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

238
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what should we do now?</font>

239
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why panic?</font>

240
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's fight to the death.</font>

241
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To the bitter end.</font>

242
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

243
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is right over there.</font>

244
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to find a boat
and get there fast.</font>

245
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at the hour.</font>

246
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where would we find a boat now?</font>

247
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who goes there?</font>

248
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stand back at once.</font>

249
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang.</font>

250
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What brings you here?</font>

251
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you looking for the Duke?</font>

252
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

253
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father sent me to assist him.</font>

254
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

255
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me find a boat.</font>

256
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang.</font>

257
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All the boats have already departed.</font>

258
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have urgent business out on the lake.</font>

259
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just find one.</font>

260
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough with the chatter.</font>

261
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Figure something out.</font>

262
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang.</font>

263
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need not go.</font>

264
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone returned from the lake earlier.</font>

265
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard</font>

266
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that everyone on the lake is dead.</font>

267
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All dead?</font>

268
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did no one escape?</font>

269
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some did.</font>

270
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They say the most honored one</font>

271
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fled early with a small group.</font>

272
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They set</font>

273
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this island ablaze themselves.</font>

274
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

275
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may go.</font>

276
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more thing.</font>

277
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you see my father,</font>

278
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do not mention we met.</font>

279
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

280
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

281
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

282
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince might still be alive.</font>

283
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle may have taken him.</font>

284
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even my father found no trace of him.</font>

285
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still intend to search?</font>

286
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wherever he is,</font>

287
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:09,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whether he's dead or alive,</font>

288
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will find him.</font>

289
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle can't have gone far so soon.</font>

290
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where do you think she'd hide?</font>

291
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In such a short time,</font>

292
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">leaving the city is impossible.</font>

293
00:14:25,040 --> 00:14:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The most dangerous place is the safest.</font>

294
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were Changle,</font>

295
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd never abandon power in Yanjing.</font>

296
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Instead, I'd burn my boats</font>

297
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and strike one final blow.</font>

298
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:36,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then where would she go?</font>

299
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her mansion.</font>

300
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

301
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing I had a backup plan.</font>

302
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, I would have been buried</font>

303
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">along with Nightfall Haven
on that island.</font>

304
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

305
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what should we do</font>

306
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with Prince Duan?</font>

307
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He ruined my grand scheme.</font>

308
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He deserves death by a thousand cuts</font>

309
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to quell the hatred in my heart.</font>

310
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But given the current situation,</font>

311
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sparing his life</font>

312
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might prove useful at a critical moment.</font>

313
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Throw him in the dungeon.</font>

314
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just don't beat him to death.</font>

315
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

316
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It should be around here.</font>

317
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

318
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's split up and search.</font>

319
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

320
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

321
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan?</font>

322
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

323
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

324
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai.</font>

325
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All this time,</font>

326
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you haven't said a word.</font>

327
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you curious where we are?</font>

328
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you brought me here,</font>

329
00:16:26,800 --> 00:16:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it must be safe.</font>

330
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold me.</font>

331
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The place is safe,</font>

332
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the person might not be.</font>

333
00:16:47,640 --> 00:16:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saved you from Qin Mansion</font>

334
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and fed you well all these years.</font>

335
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be an ingrate</font>

336
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and betray me.</font>

337
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would pledge my life</font>

338
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to protect you.</font>

339
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:09,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My loyalty is absolute.</font>

340
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then tell me. Why did you appear</font>

341
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so coincidentally?</font>

342
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was almost</font>

343
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as if you were waiting
for Prince Duan to kill me.</font>

344
00:17:21,760 --> 00:17:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If avenging you</font>

345
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is an act I should not have committed,</font>

346
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no defense to offer.</font>

347
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I submit to your judgment.</font>

348
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look how frightened you are.</font>

349
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was only jesting with you.</font>

350
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These past few days,</font>

351
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have been rather weary.</font>

352
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have had a long day as well.</font>

353
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tonight, you must get a good rest.</font>

354
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow,</font>

355
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the control of Beiyuan</font>

356
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will change hands.</font>

357
00:17:58,230 --> 00:18:00,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

358
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

359
00:18:02,770 --> 00:18:06,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

360
00:18:06,690 --> 00:18:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

361
00:18:11,370 --> 00:18:14,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

362
00:18:15,350 --> 00:18:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

363
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

364
00:18:24,210 --> 00:18:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

365
00:18:32,350 --> 00:18:36,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

366
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

367
00:18:41,070 --> 00:18:45,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

368
00:18:45,610 --> 00:18:48,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

369
00:18:49,590 --> 00:18:53,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

370
00:18:54,190 --> 00:18:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
